
### Add User
POST http://localhost:5222/safevault/adduser
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_jwt_token_here>

{
  "firstname": "Saimah",
  "lastname": "Tocalo",
  "email": "SMT110394@gmail.com",
  "username": "saimahMT03",
  "password": "@iloveProgramming<3",
  "type": 2,
  "applicationSignature": "SafeVaultClient"
}

